    "author": "塞壬唱片",
    "content": "<p><span style=\"color:#999999\">响彻赛场的喝彩，试图为冠军加冕，</span></p><p><span style=\"color:#999999\">可是朋友们，我们的荣誉无需证明。</span></p><p><span style=\"color:#999999\">商人在摇旗呐喊，资本利欲熏心。</span></p><p><span style=\"color:#999999\">Field in the Light，而我们挣脱囚笼、迎接光明。、</span></p><p></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\"><img id=\"c4ab8bc7e04d3d543d9a1908129082eb\" title=\"图片.png\" alt=\"图片.png\" poster=\"\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/siren/pic/20211224/c4ab8bc7e04d3d543d9a1908129082eb.png\"/></div><p></p>",
